{"seq":2,"slug":"effect-modification","title":"效应修饰与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/effect-modification","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"效应修饰与交互\">效应修饰与交互</h1><p>同一种药，在年轻人身上几乎无害，在老年人身上却显著增加出血风险——暴露的效应大小，随着第三个变量的取值而改变。这不是需要消除的污染，而是值得报告的真实信号：它告诉临床「对谁该格外小心」，告诉公共卫生「资源该投向哪个亚组」。这就是效应修饰。它和混杂常被初学者混为一谈，因为分析时都涉及「第三变量」与「分层」，但二者的本质、处理方式和价值判断完全相反。把这对概念辨清，是从「会算」走向「会解读」的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>效应修饰（effect modification）指暴露对结局的效应强度，在第三变量（修饰因子）的不同层次上不同。混杂是「需要扣除的虚假」，效应修饰是「需要呈现的真实」。判断标准很直接：按修饰因子分层后，若各层的关联度量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）彼此不同，就存在效应修饰；若各层关联相近、但与未分层时不同，那是混杂。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[按第三变量分层] --&gt; B{各层关联是否相同}&#10;    B --&gt;|各层相近&lt;br/&gt;但异于粗估| C[混杂&lt;br/&gt;合并调整后估计]&#10;    B --&gt;|各层不同| D[效应修饰&lt;br/&gt;分层报告各层估计]&#10;    C --&gt; E[报告单一调整值]&#10;    D --&gt; F[不可合并&lt;br/&gt;分别呈现]&#10;    F --&gt; G[识别高危亚组&lt;br/&gt;指导精准干预]\">flowchart TD\n    A[按第三变量分层] --&gt; B{各层关联是否相同}\n    B --&gt;|各层相近&lt;br/&gt;但异于粗估| C[混杂&lt;br/&gt;合并调整后估计]\n    B --&gt;|各层不同| D[效应修饰&lt;br/&gt;分层报告各层估计]\n    C --&gt; E[报告单一调整值]\n    D --&gt; F[不可合并&lt;br/&gt;分别呈现]\n    F --&gt; G[识别高危亚组&lt;br/&gt;指导精准干预]</pre><p>下表把这对孪生概念的每一处差异并列，是辨别二者最实用的速查表。它与 <a href=\"bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a> 中的混杂处理直接互补——那里教你怎么消除混杂，这里教你怎么发现并保留效应修饰。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>混杂</th>\n<th>效应修饰</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本质</td>\n<td>虚假关联的来源</td>\n<td>真实的效应异质性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否想要</td>\n<td>不想要，须消除</td>\n<td>想要，须报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层后表现</td>\n<td>各层一致、异于粗估</td>\n<td>各层不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理方式</td>\n<td>合并为单一调整值</td>\n<td>分层呈现，不合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据属性</td>\n<td>取决于本研究人群</td>\n<td>生物/社会层面的真实属性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加法尺度与乘法尺度-交互的两副面孔\">加法尺度与乘法尺度：交互的两副面孔</h2><p>「交互」（interaction）比效应修饰更偏统计语言，且有一个常被忽略的微妙之处：交互是否存在，取决于你用加法尺度还是乘法尺度衡量。乘法尺度看相对危险度是否相乘，加法尺度看绝对危险度是否相加。同一组数据，可能在一个尺度上有交互、在另一个尺度上没有。</p>\n<p>设暴露 A 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR_A=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>、暴露 B 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR_B=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>。若两者同时存在时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR_{AB}=6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>，恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，则乘法尺度上无交互；但绝对风险上，若基线风险为 1%，则 A 单独 2%、B 单独 3%、合计期望应为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\% + (2\\%-1\\%) + (3\\%-1\\%) = 4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span>，而实际是 6%，加法尺度上存在正交互（协同）。两个尺度的判断标准如下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>乘法交互</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>加法交互(RERI)</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{乘法交互} = RR_{AB} - RR_A \\times RR_B, \\quad \\text{加法交互(RERI)} = RR_{AB} - RR_A - RR_B + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">乘法交互</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加法交互</span><span class=\"mord\">(RERI)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>为什么这区分重要？因为公共卫生决策关心的是绝对风险——加法尺度上的协同意味着「同时干预两个因素能避免的病例数，超过分别干预之和」，这直接决定干预优先级。而生物学机制研究常用乘法尺度。报告交互时必须言明用的是哪个尺度，否则「有无交互」的结论可能自相矛盾。这一尺度依赖性，也是 <a href=\"../foundations/disease-frequency\">疾病频率测量</a> 中绝对风险（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）与相对风险（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）之分在交互层面的延续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生物学交互与统计学交互\">生物学交互与统计学交互</h2><p>需要厘清的还有「统计交互」与「生物学交互」的不对应。统计交互是数据上的现象——某尺度上联合效应偏离了主效应的简单组合。生物学交互（又称协同作用，sufficient-cause interaction）则指两个原因在同一个体内必须共同存在才能致病的因果机制，对应 Rothman「充分原因—构成原因」模型里同一个充分原因饼图里的两块。</p>\n<p>二者不能简单互推：乘法尺度上没有统计交互，生物学上可能仍有协同；加法尺度上的正交互更接近、但也不等同于生物学协同。这种关系的判定属于 <a href=\"../foundations/causal-inference\">因果推断框架</a> 的深水区，涉及潜在结果框架下的「协同充分原因」定义。对基础学习者，关键认知是：不要看到回归模型里交互项 p 值不显著，就断言「两因素无生物学协同」——统计尺度与生物机制是两回事，前者还受样本量和尺度选择左右。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践中的识别与报告\">实践中的识别与报告</h2><p>分层分析是识别效应修饰的标准做法，它与混杂检查共用同一套分层操作，区别只在于「看各层是否相同」这个判断。一个规范的流程是：先按候选第三变量分层，比较各层关联；若各层明显不同，报告效应修饰、分层呈现，并可用同质性检验（如 Breslow–Day 检验）辅助判断各层差异是否超出机遇；若各层相近，则按 <a href=\"bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a> 的方法合并为调整估计。下表给出一个典型判读示例。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>修饰因子层</th>\n<th>暴露组风险</th>\n<th>非暴露组风险</th>\n<th>层内 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>判读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>年轻</td>\n<td>2%</td>\n<td>1.8%</td>\n<td>1.1</td>\n<td>几乎无效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年老</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n<td>4%</td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td>强效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上例中年龄是明显的效应修饰因子，绝不能把两层合并报一个平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>——那会同时掩盖「年轻人基本安全」和「老年人高危」两条对决策至关重要的信息。在回归模型里，效应修饰通过加入交互项（暴露 × 修饰因子）来检验和估计，但务必配合分层结果解读，单凭交互项系数易误导。报告时还需警惕：亚组分析做得越多，靠机遇撞出「假交互」的概率越高，这与 <a href=\"../applications/surveillance-evidence\">监测与循证决策</a> 中对多重比较和事后亚组分析的审慎一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效应修饰是暴露效应随第三变量取值而真实变化，与混杂相反：混杂要消除，效应修饰要报告。</li>\n<li>辨别靠分层——各层关联不同是效应修饰（分层呈现、不合并），各层相近但异于粗估是混杂（合并调整）。</li>\n<li>交互的有无依赖尺度：乘法尺度看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是否相乘，加法尺度看绝对风险是否相加（RERI），二者可不一致。</li>\n<li>加法尺度的协同对公共卫生（绝对可避免病例数）更关键，乘法尺度多用于机制；报告必须言明尺度。</li>\n<li>统计交互不等于生物学协同；亚组分析越多越易撞出假交互，需配同质性检验并警惕多重比较。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效应修饰与交互","id":"效应修饰与交互"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"加法尺度与乘法尺度：交互的两副面孔","id":"加法尺度与乘法尺度-交互的两副面孔"},{"level":2,"text":"生物学交互与统计学交互","id":"生物学交互与统计学交互"},{"level":2,"text":"实践中的识别与报告","id":"实践中的识别与报告"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"偏倚与混杂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/bias-confounding"},"next":{"title":"筛查与诊断试验评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/bias-effects/screening-diagnostic"}}